>> title: French Apple Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: apple, rum, dessert, oven
>> servings: 8
>> time: 1 hr 15 min

Butter an #8-in springform pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Whisk @eggs{2%large}, @granulated sugar{2/3%cup}(135 g), @dark rum{3%Tbs}(45 mL), @vanilla extract{1/2%tsp}(2.5 mL).

Whisk @melted unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g; cooled) into @&(~1)egg mixture{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{3/4%cup}(95 g), @baking powder{3/4%tsp}(3 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Fold @apples{4%medium}(600 g; peeled, cut in 1-in chunks) into @&(~1)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 350°F for ~{50%min}.
